@ZenLead.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5114

### Register (copy accessToken/refreshToken from the response)
POST {{ZenLead.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "workspaceName": "Acme", "email": "owner@acme.test", "password": "Passw0rd!", "displayName": "Owner" }

### Login
POST {{ZenLead.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner@acme.test", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### Refresh
POST {{ZenLead.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "<paste refresh token>" }

### Create lead
POST {{ZenLead.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/leads
Authorization: Bearer <paste access token>
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Jane Doe", "email": "jane@example.com", "title": "CTO" }

### List leads
GET {{ZenLead.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/leads
Authorization: Bearer <paste access token>
